  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, combine sliced beef, Thai chilies, lime juice, fish sauce, brown sugar, and larb spice mix. Mix well to combine.",
    "2. Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "3. Just before serving, stir in chopped peanuts and Thai basil.",
    "4. Serve the larb beef mixture over steamed rice, garnished with additional Thai basil and peanuts if desired."
